# Direct runtime dependencies of the Lambda handlers (PirIngestor, PirLinker,
# PirQuery). boto3 is provided by the Lambda runtime and is intentionally
# omitted. Versions match what the SAM-deployed functions ran.
#
# requirements.txt is the lock terraform installs into the layer. Regenerate it
# after editing this file (from the repo root):
#
#   uv pip compile src/handlers/requirements.in \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 \
#     --output-file src/handlers/requirements.txt
